# Własność pliku i uwierzytelnianie haseł konfiguruje administrator brokera.
# Każdy komponent używa osobnego konta, aby ograniczyć skutki wycieku hasła.

user aquacyd_gateway
topic write aquacyd/aquarium/state
topic write aquacyd/aquarium/availability
topic write aquacyd/aquarium/command/ack
topic read aquacyd/aquarium/command/set
topic write homeassistant/sensor/aquacyd_aquarium/#
topic write homeassistant/binary_sensor/aquacyd_aquarium/#

user aquacyd_hmi
topic read aquacyd/aquarium/state
topic read aquacyd/aquarium/availability
topic read aquacyd/aquarium/command/ack
topic write aquacyd/aquarium/command/set
topic write aquacyd/aquarium/hmi/availability

user homeassistant
topic readwrite aquacyd/aquarium/#
topic read homeassistant/sensor/aquacyd_aquarium/#
topic read homeassistant/binary_sensor/aquacyd_aquarium/#
